  <title xml:lang="EN">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Special Climate Change Fund</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1" xml:lang="EN">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The SCCF is a trust fund administered by the Global Environment Facility (GEF) and is part of the GEF Family of Funds. Results from initiatives financed through the SCCF are available in annual reports, presented to Council on an annual basis: https://www.thegef.org/what-we-do/topics/climate-change-adaptation#results</narrative>
  </description>
  <description type="2" xml:lang="EN">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The Special Climate Change Fund (SCCF) provides support to developing countries, with priority on SIDS, to reduce vulnerabilities and build adaptive capacities and resilience to the adverse effects of climate change, and support implementation of the Paris Agreement.</narrative>
  </description>
